Backport GBM plane accessors for the ELVEES Mesa 17 / PVR DRI v8 branch.
Adapted from Mesa 17.3.9's GBM implementation:
https://archive.mesa3d.org/older-versions/17.x/mesa-17.3.9.tar.xz

Explicit-modifier allocation remains unsupported. Report ENOSYS so clients
can use the existing implicit-layout allocation/export/import path.
The public GBM ABI is extended; rebuild the matching EGL/GBM/DRI set together.
Also remove the obsolete ARGB8888 scanout prohibition, as in Mesa 17.3.9.
Real ARGB scanout allocation/export/EGL import passes on the MCom-03 display
allocator (card0); PowerVR's renderD128 allocator cannot allocate scanout BOs.

